title: Hello
color: blue
position: -36,-75
---
<<if not $once_hello>>
Alchemy. What a theme. Am I right? How to represent a protoscientific school of hermetic wisdom? Okay, let's try the four elements.
<<set $once_hello to true>>
<<set $earth to 0>>
<<set $water to 0>>
<<set $fire to 0>>
<<set $air to 0>>
<<else>>
Four elements.
<<endif>>
-> Water
-> Earth
  <<declare $cube_size = 0.5 as number>>
  <<if $earth == 0>>
  <<set $cube_size = 0.5>>
  Do cubes count?
  <<set $earth = $earth + 1>>
  <<attach_script_5 "spawn" 5 5 0 {$cube_size} Glass>>
  <<elseif $earth == 1>>
  How about a lot of cubes?
  <<set $earth = $earth + 1>>
  <<set $cube_size to 0.75>>
  <<attach_script_5 "spawn" 5 10 0 {$cube_size} Wood>>
  <<else>>
  <<if $earth < 3>>
  How about just too many cubes?
  <<set $earth = $earth + 1>>
  <<set $cube_size = 1.0>>
  <<set $mat = "Stone">>
  <<else>>
  I'm out of ideas.
  <<set $mat = "Sand">>
  <<set $cube_size = $cube_size + 0.25>>
  <<endif>>
  <<attach_script_5 "spawn" 7 13 5 {$cube_size} {$mat}>>
  <<endif>>
-> Fire
-> Air
-> Don't make excuses.
    You're right, I should take more responsibility.
	-> Nod
		But really. Eight days. Two of those porting all my stuff and some 3rd-party stuff to 0.20.
		-> Boo hoo.
			You get it, though, right?
			<<attach_script_3 "spawn" 5 5 0>>
		-> Sounds like fun!
			Yeah, I guess it is!
			<<attach_script_3 "spawn" 15 20 0>>
-> That's fine.
  Look at physics plus sound.
  <<attach_script_3 "spawn" 10 5 0>>
-> Did you have help?
  Nope.
Neep.
<<dialogue_stop>>


===

title: Pets
---
Do you like animals? They were being used in experiments.
-> Pets are nice.
  Sometimes they are. You heard about cats and dogs?
  -> Yes.
    Look at these two. Can't get along.
    <<attach_script_3 "spawn_pets" -7.5 0.1 -2.0>>
    <<jump Hello>>
    <<dialogue_stop>>
  -> No.
    Oh. They're like, little animals, originally wild, but now domesticated.
    <<jump Hello>>
    <<dialogue_stop>>

